ontent/icons/ab0837be56c8d5cfc474acd4f3f9c7ac.png","desc":"Reloading after defeating a target greatly increases target acquisition and aim down sight speed for a short duration."},{"name":"Heal Clip","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/3d0f2eb4c1e4f66f2bd897ec4d5ce4f1.png","desc":"Reloading shortly after dealing a final blow grants Cure to you and your nearby allies."},{"name":"Incandescent","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/22ed4a2cd5a0eb129a14ce77db49373f.png","desc":"Defeating a target spreads scorch to those nearby.\nMore powerful combatants and opposing Guardians cause scorch in a larger radius."},{"name":"Butterfly","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/eb3ba71043446a256c3f6405b868eb08.png","desc":"Aiming this weapon for a short period without firing causes your target to explode the next time you deal final blows. Timer resets when you stop aiming down sights."},{"name":"Light Touch","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/46b000a4e8c4ffa73df16c26a63360e0.png","desc":"This weapon gains reload speed, handling, and aim down sight speed when you are amplified, radiant, or have Devour."},{"name":"Wellspring","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/ec2e3096ebd447bd6137735c9067b991.png","desc":"Kills with this weapon generate ability energy. This energy is divided between your uncharged abilities."},{"name":"Surplus","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/a4c054c3547840300b9ce7ef11b7b6fc.png","desc":"Increases handling, reload speed, and stability for each fully charged ability."},{"name":"Killing Wind","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/db2aa71ff6d808929bb0e668dcf0822e.png","desc":"Final blows grant increased mobility, weapon range, and handling for a short duration."}]},{"label":"Trait","weight":3,"perks":[{"name":"Firefly","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/629e225e6f8214326bc1eb0a911a6f6d.png","desc":"Precision kills with this weapon increase reload speed and cause the target to explode, dealing Solar damage to nearby enemies."},{"name":"Kill Clip","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/0afd4799427004b2d8170ab213a2ef0c.png","desc":"Reloading after a kill grants increased damage."},{"name":"Desperate Measures","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/25692d31f4963c07c3a82aba508b52b6.png","desc":"Weapon final blows grant bonus damage. Melee and grenade final blows grant a larger damage bonus that can stack."},{"name":"Frenzy","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/23e06f4ced1b3e6476f342978ff5bb37.png","desc":"Being in combat for an extended time increases damage, handling, and reload for this weapon until you are out of combat."},{"name":"Paracausal Affinity","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/6cdbccd2dc6395b60163984481b334eb.png","desc":"Final blows of energy types matching this weapon's alignment grant increased damage for a short period of time. Light final blows boost Arc, Solar, and Void weapons. Darkness final blows boost Stasis and Strand weapons."},{"name":"Elemental Honing","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/ac0323ff44f720a8db7ae9f4dee59af4.png","desc":"Dealing unique elemental damage grants this weapon a stacking damage bonus. This bonus is increased for kinetic weapons."},{"name":"Explosive Payload","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/31f02e5f3bae68ecdfdd3f899cf931c7.png","desc":"Projectiles create an area-of-effect detonation on impact."},{"name":"Burning Ambition","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/f7a2484668486f64020a612bd3dd5ab9.png","desc":"Dealing sustained damage scorches the target. Dealing damage to a scorched target inflicts scorch."},{"name":"Master of Arms","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/fce1ea2064814689d7ca08a2acdb1d23.png","desc":"Kills with any weapon improve this weapon's damage for a short time."},{"name":"Disruption Break","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/45b57ce27fa0213218c7cb8f2253c517.png","desc":"Breaking an enemy's shield with this weapon makes them more vulnerable to Kinetic damage for a brief period."},{"name":"Thresh","icon":"/common/destiny2_con